        <item>
            <title>1.9</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:14:17 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://torinmb.github.io/lilfloatycam-updates/changelog/</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Resize handles are now thin arcs on the corners that appear at the corner nearest your cursor
- Four corner radius dots slide along the edge from square to circle to square, and ease onto the circle in the middle
- Corner radius stays proportional when you resize the camera, so a circle stays a circle
- Smoother corner radius dragging
]]></description>
